  "text_pages": [
    "What´s new\nSkip Navigation\n본문 바로가기\n주메뉴 바로가기\nhome\n화면작게\nBASIC\n화면크게\n페이지 인쇄\nShare\nclose\nShare\nFacebook\nTwitte\nKakaoStory\nPinterest\nURL\nSNS 공유주소 입력\ncopy\nLeading in orderly openness and living in harmony with the people and foreigners\nWe will create a mature multicultural environment and achieve stable social integration.\nimmigration_eng_ms_S\nfnctId=bbs,fnctNo=229\nFee Increase for Foreign Residence Cards  Starting January 1, 2025\nDate\n2024.12.14\nHit\n33419\nTelephone\nDepart\nEmail\nFee Increase for Foreign Residence Cards (Incl. Overseas Korean Residence Cards)\nEffective January 1, 2025, Foreign Residence Cards will include an integrated IC chip to store the Personal Identification Number\n(currently required for issuing mobile Foreign Residence Cards) directly on the physical card.\nAs a result of this upgrade, the issuance fee for Foreign Residence Cards, including Permanent Residence Cards\nand Overseas Korean Residence Cards will increase starting January 1, 2025.\nNew issuance fee\n:\n35,000 won\n(\npreviously 30,000 won).\nExisting Foreign Residence Cards will remain valid and do not need to be replaced unless required, such\nas in cases of expiration.\nHowever, if cardholders choose to reissue their card, the new fee will apply.\n첨부파일\n법무부의 해당 저작물은 “\n공공누리 1유형(출처표시)\n” 조건에 따라 누구나 이용할 수 있습니다.\n법무부의 해당 저작물은 “\n공공누리 2유형(출처표시)\n” 조건에 따라 누구나 이용할 수 있습니다.\n법무부의 해당 저작물은 “\n공공누리 3유형(출처표시)\n” 조건에 따라 누구나 이용할 수 있습니다.\n법무부의 해당 저작물은 “\n공공누리 4유형(출처표시)\n” 조건에 따라 누구나 이용할 수 있습니다.\nTop"
